== Description ==

'''Transformer''' is an electronic component in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Electronics Workbench]]. It appears as an ingredient in 5 downstream recipes at the [[Mechanical Workbench]], including [[Laser Trap]], [[Solar Generator]], [[Sensor Spike]], [[Rotating Blade]], [[Rotating Circular Saw]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

